<title>USA: Miami customs flush out cocaine haul.</title>
<headline>Miami customs flush out cocaine haul.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. customs officers in Miami on Monday flushed out a ton (909 kg) of cocaine hidden in a shipment of toilets. The haul was discovered on board a freighter that arrived from Colombia, a customs service statement said.</p>
